        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, Elaine. Marcus Lim here, calling for our arranged appointment. Are you somewhere comfortable to speak? Before we get into the review, I'll do the routine identity check."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Morning, Marcus. Yes, I'm in my office with the door closed, so now is fine. [[EV_012]] [[EV_013]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you, Elaine. I'll keep the conversation straightforward. I've got your appointment notes in front of me, and we can cover the review first, then sort out future telephone arrangements."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "That suits me. I've put aside some time before my next meeting. [[EV_014]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_015]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_019]]"
        },
